<title>USA: Hurst Cmnty Services, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Hurst Cmnty Services, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc said it won $2.300 million of Hurst Community Services Development Corp, sales tax revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.57 percent.</p>
